WEBVTT

00:27:29.913 --> 00:27:34.163
But that is because changing your mind
is really quite difficult. That is

00:27:36.121 --> 00:27:39.538
Dan Gilbert has a beautiful word
equal that unbelieving

00:27:39.829 --> 00:27:42.246
and unbelieving things are very difficult.

00:27:42.246 --> 00:27:49.496
So I find it extremely hard to unbelieve
aspects of Pozza thinking fast and slow,

00:27:49.496 --> 00:27:51.746
even though I know that my grounds

00:27:51.746 --> 00:27:54.538
for believing them are now much
weaker than they were.

00:27:55.163 --> 00:28:00.621
But the more significant thing
that I have begun to rethink.